          "priority": "core",
          "pronunciation_source": "not_generated",
          "pronunciation_qa": "pending_mandarin_and_myanmar_teacher_review",
          "source_ref": "user_provided_05.05.02_001"
        },
        {
          "id": "05.05.02-S002",
          "text": "一百块能找开吗？",
          "meaning_my": "ယွမ်တစ်ရာတန်ကို အမ်းပေးလို့ရလား။",
          "replies": [
