          "source_ref": "user_provided_05.05.02_004"
        },
        {
          "id": "05.05.02-S005",
          "text": "好像少找了十块。",
          "meaning_my": "ဆယ်ယွမ် လျော့အမ်းထားသလိုပဲ။",
          "replies": [
